            <div xml:id="d517">

                <pb facs="0573" n="485" xml:id="pg485"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1206: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-20T12:00:00-02:00">February 20,
                        1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received February 20—10:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>28. My telegram No. 27, February 18, 3 p.m. Major Sackville will leave by Pan Air
                    February 25th reaching Para 27th where Brazilian Government’s facilities will
                    begin. His cable address will be American Consul Pará.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
